# DAB's env now lives in the ROOT .env.dev / .env.prod (see ../.env.example) — POC.DAB keeps no
# env files of its own. DAB reads a file literally named `.env` (DotNetEnv); if you create a local
# one (e.g. Copy-Item ..\.env.dev .env for a manual `dab start`), it is ignored.
.env
.env.*

# DAB-generated merged configs (artifacts of dab validate/start)
*.merged.json

# Build artifacts
bin/
obj/

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user

docs/*